Z||000000||XDrewX||08-11-2001||12:01 AM||||I am about to do a flush and fill to the radiator system.  I wanted to use the pink DEX-COOL antifreeze/coolant,(since all of my other vehicles came from factory with it). The specs say it was formulated for brass or aluminum.<BR>Does anyone know what our radiators are made of.<BR>I have an 87 GT<P>thanks||||reg||1
